# Claim Audit Query
# Claim-Faithfulness 审计状态跟踪

```dataview
TABLE project, paper_section, audit_status, claims_total, claims_verified, claims_failed, high_warn_count, created
FROM "5_学术研究织网/claim_audit"
WHERE type = "claim-tracking"
SORT created DESC
```

## 待处理声明

```dataview
TABLE claim_id, claim_text, source, anchor_type, audit_status
FROM "5_学术研究织网/claim_audit"
WHERE type = "claim-tracking"
WHERE audit_status = "pending"
FLATTEN claims as claim
WHERE claim.audit_status = "pending"
```

## HIGH-WARN 声明

```dataview
TABLE project, claim_id, claim_text, high_warn_category, audit_status
FROM "5_学术研究织网/claim_audit"
WHERE type = "claim-tracking"
WHERE high_warn_count > 0
SORT project ASC, claim_id ASC
```

## 声明验证进度

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  project AS "Project",
  claims_total AS "Total",
  claims_verified AS "Verified",
  claims_failed AS "Failed",
  claims_pending AS "Pending",
  round(claims_verified / claims_total * 100, 1) AS "Progress %"
FROM "5_学术研究织网/claim_audit"
WHERE type = "claim-tracking"
SORT project ASC
```